WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:04.650
Four golfers, four golf balls, four
completely different destinations. And

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.280
yet, for decades,

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.260
golfers have been expected to move
together, waiting, searching, stopping for

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.300
each other.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.630
But golf was never meant to feel crowded.
Watch what happens when every golfer moves

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.480
freely.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.140
No hesitation, no interruptions, no
compromise in rhythm.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.080
Each player simply flows naturally towards
their own game.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.090
This is the beauty of single-rider golf
mobility. Faster rhythm, greater freedom,

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.020
more golf, more fun.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.180
At INNOXONE, we believe golf deserved a
better experience. So we dreamed it,

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.140
designed it, engineered it.
